1
00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:04,130
I want to share some information about the ongoing disciplinary

2
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:08,350
process between Manchester City and the Premier League.

3
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:10,580
Essentially, we DID it.

4
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:14,000
But I think people are being very negative about that.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,190
A document has been published which is negative to our interests.

6
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:22,780
Unfortunately, it is also quite ACCURATE.

7
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:27,150
We had specifically asked for those two things not to happen together.

8
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:31,330
I want to explain what happens next, how we will defend the club,

9
00:00:31,330 --> 00:00:35,200
and why doing everything they accused us of doesn't necessarily

10
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:38,010
mean we should face CONSEQUENCES.

11
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:40,090
We've checked with our lawyers.

12
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:43,450
They're happy to discuss that for several more years.

13
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:46,670
The whole case is based on one accusation:

14
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:50,090
that our owner's personal money was secretly put into the club

15
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:51,690
through sponsors.

16
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:52,900
YES.

17
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:56,750
But "secretly" makes it sound sinister.

18
00:00:56,750 --> 00:01:00,340
We simply didn't tell the people who would have STOPPED us.

19
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:04,270
And the money didn't come DIRECTLY from the owner.

20
00:01:04,270 --> 00:01:06,970
It went through a sponsor first.

21
00:01:06,970 --> 00:01:09,090
Completely different pocket.

22
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:15,030
I don't understand why everyone keeps bringing up the TROUSERS.

23
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:19,140
We supplied IRREFUTABLE evidence.

24
00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:23,370
Bank statements. Money transfers. Witnesses.

25
00:01:23,370 --> 00:01:27,560
Everything necessary to demonstrate EXACTLY what we'd

26
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,520
done.

27
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:32,630
We thought they would appreciate how organised we were.

28
00:01:32,630 --> 00:01:35,400
Instead, they followed the money.

29
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,830
ALL the way.

30
00:01:36,830 --> 00:01:40,390
Which, frankly, felt a bit obsessive.

31
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:46,210
Every other charge comes from that one simple arrangement.

32
00:01:46,210 --> 00:01:50,750
People say "one hundred and fifteen" as though we sat down and

33
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:54,810
broke one hundred and fifteen SEPARATE rules.

34
00:01:54,810 --> 00:01:57,880
We were much more efficient than that.

35
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:01,140
And these charges have been aggressively marketed and

36
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:02,610
promoted.

37
00:02:02,610 --> 00:02:06,050
Every newspaper. Every television channel.

38
00:02:07,290 --> 00:02:10,850
We normally pay a fortune for that kind of coverage,

39
00:02:10,850 --> 00:02:14,440
and suddenly nobody wants their logo next to us.

40
00:02:15,110 --> 00:02:18,400
After nearly two years, the commission has agreed with the

41
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,840
Premier League.

42
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:23,720
Apparently, if you provide enough evidence that something happened,

43
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:26,330
they decide it HAPPENED.

44
00:02:26,330 --> 00:02:28,730
Nobody explained that part to us.

45
00:02:29,470 --> 00:02:32,790
They have completely ignored the wider context.

46
00:02:32,790 --> 00:02:34,830
The football was LOVELY.

47
00:02:34,830 --> 00:02:36,420
You've seen the passing.

48
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:39,750
Surely that cancels out a few bank transfers.

49
00:02:40,390 --> 00:02:44,690
Our lawyers will now appeal because the ruling contains serious

50
00:02:44,690 --> 00:02:47,880
errors of law, principle and fact.

51
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:50,370
The LAW was applied to us.

52
00:02:50,370 --> 00:02:53,060
PRINCIPLES were expected of us.

53
00:02:53,060 --> 00:02:56,040
And the FACTS have been made public.

54
00:02:56,860 --> 00:02:58,960
You can see why we are concerned.

55
00:02:59,570 --> 00:03:02,290
Remember, we have been here before.

56
00:03:02,290 --> 00:03:05,830
In 2020, we appealed to CAS and won.

57
00:03:05,830 --> 00:03:08,720
We mention this whenever ANYTHING happens.

58
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:10,780
Parking ticket? CAS.

59
00:03:10,780 --> 00:03:13,050
Late invoice? CAS.

60
00:03:13,050 --> 00:03:16,100
My wife says I haven't emptied the dishwasher?

61
00:03:16,100 --> 00:03:18,550
We've been CLEARED of this before.

62
00:03:18,550 --> 00:03:22,690
We will pursue every legal avenue available.

63
00:03:22,690 --> 00:03:28,130
Our preference remains the avenue where we KEEP everything and

64
00:03:28,130 --> 00:03:31,690
everyone else stops fucking asking.

65
00:03:31,690 --> 00:03:36,170
We will also seek compensation from anyone damaging our

66
00:03:36,170 --> 00:03:37,730
reputation.

67
00:03:37,730 --> 00:03:41,020
Yes, our actions contributed.

68
00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:45,910
But people FINDING OUT has made it considerably worse.

69
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:51,720
I know this is a distraction. Please remain focused on our business

70
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:54,600
and our extended City family.

71
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:59,590
And remember: just because the money goes round several relatives

72
00:03:59,590 --> 00:04:04,870
before reaching you doesn't make it any less of a GIFT.

73
00:04:04,870 --> 00:04:09,150
Please follow the usual procedure for enquiries.

74
00:04:09,150 --> 00:04:13,450
If a supporter asks, say we are INNOCENT.

75
00:04:13,450 --> 00:04:17,610
If a journalist asks, say we are APPEALING.

76
00:04:18,430 --> 00:04:23,290
If a sponsor asks, check whether it's actually the owner.

77
00:04:23,290 --> 00:04:28,180
Very soon, we will look back on this as another time we faced adversity

78
00:04:28,180 --> 00:04:30,060
and overcame it together.

79
00:04:30,060 --> 00:04:32,930
Admittedly, we CREATED the adversity.

80
00:04:32,930 --> 00:04:35,650
But we also created the sponsorship revenue.

81
00:04:35,650 --> 00:04:38,460
You have to look at the POSITIVES.

82
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:39,340
Thank you.

83
00:04:39,340 --> 00:04:43,460
And please remember: money cannot buy success.

84
00:04:43,460 --> 00:04:47,330
According to our lawyers, it merely arrives independently,

85
00:04:47,330 --> 00:04:51,670
through a commercial partner, shortly before success happens.

